basic attributes like atomic weight and oxidation states to advanced data such as ionization energies, spectral lines, and half-life. Data is presented with clear structure and visual heatmaps across periods and groups.\n\nAll elements are available as detailed 3D models that can be explored in Augmented Reality. Place elements in your environment, examine their physical form, and view them from any angle in real scale.\n\nTalbica also features an animated Bohr atomic model and interactive electron orbital visualizations, helping to understand atomic structure and quantum concepts that are difficult to grasp from static images.\n\nThe app includes a large compounds database with key physical and chemical properties, as well as a reactions reference with thousands of balanced chemical reactions and their conditions.\n\nTalbica replaces static textbooks with an intuitive, visual, and immersive way to explore chemistry.", "short_description": "Talbica is a visual chemistry app featuring a full periodic table, compounds database, and reactions reference. All elements are available as 3D models in AR. Explore the animated Bohr atomic model and interactive electron orbital visualizations to better understand atomic structure. Designed for intuitive learning through spatial visualization."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.talbica.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Talbica", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.talbica.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": nu